You can use ggtree(fulltree, layout='circular') + geom_tiplab2() in future release.

geom_tiplab2 is equivalent to geom_tiplab(aes(subset=(abs(angle) < 90), angle=angle)) + geom_tiplab(aes(subset=(abs(angle) >= 90), angle=angle+180), hjust=1)

